{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52375","headline":"回波乐 十八 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若个达苦空？世间无有一。\n不见己身非，唯都（项校「覩」）他家失。\n贪儿觅长命，论时熟痴汉。\n终归不免死，受苦无崖畔。\n非但少衣食，王役偏差唤。\n不如早殡地，愁苦一时散。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}